{
  "slug": "scout",
  "name": "Scout",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Web search and content fetching with privacy-aware tool selection. Turns vague questions into optimized multi-engine queries, evaluates result quality, and re-searches when needed. Includes HyDE semantic search via Exa and automatic privacy classification for URL fetching.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `fetch` (Fetch web page content from URLs), `search` (Web search and content fetching), `setup` (Guided interactive setup for scout's search engines and fetching tools)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `exa-free`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install scout@claude-community` from `shidoyu/scout`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
